  "description": "Pinecone vector store implementation for Mythosia VectorDb. Uses Pinecone index as physical storage with native namespace partitioning, metadata-based scope filtering, GetBatchAsync, CountAsync, and connection verification.",
  "id": "Mythosia.VectorDb.Pinecone",
  "isPrerelease": false,
