  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v2.0.0: Requires Abstractions v3.0.0 — VectorFilter.ByMetadata/ByNamespace/ByScope and MetadataMatch are removed. Use new fluent API: new VectorFilter().Where(...). Pinecone metadata filter builder updated for the full condition tree: Eq→$eq, Ne→$ne, Gt/Gte/Lt/Lte→$gt/$gte/$lt/$lte, In→$in, NotIn→$nin, And/Or groups→$and/$or. Like/Exists/NotExists silently skipped server-side, evaluated client-side in MatchesFilter.",
